# Normalise line endings. The repo stores LF and every platform checks out LF.
# Without this, Windows checked out CRLF while the generator scripts write LF,
# so `git status` listed all 34 product pages as modified after every run of
# generate-products.js even though the content was byte-identical.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never convert these.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf  binary
